  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n <head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n  <script async=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n  </script>\n  <script>\n   window.MathJax = {\n                        tex: {\n                        inlineMath: [\n                            [\"$\", \"$\"],\n                            [\"\\\\(\", \"\\\\)\"],\n                        ],\n                        displayMath: [\n                            [\"$$\", \"$$\"],\n                            [\"\\\\[\", \"\\\\]\"],\n                        ],\n                        processEscapes: true,\n                        processEnvironments: true,\n                        },\n                        options: {\n                        skipHtmlTags: [\"script\", \"noscript\", \"style\", \"textarea\", \"pre\"],\n                        },\n                    };\n                    if(window.MathJax && window.MathJax.typeset) {\n                        MathJax.Hub.Queue([\"Typeset\", MathJax.Hub]);\n                    }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n   table {\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        width: 100%;\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n        thead tr th {\n        border-top: 2px solid #000;\n        border-bottom: 2px solid #000;\n        padding: 8px;\n        background: #f6f6f6;\n        }\n        tbody td {\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: center;\n        }\n  </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Привет</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"> Я картошка. Я делаю<strong>&nbsp;t h i n g s</strong><br></span></p>\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Industries Potato Vehicle aims to add whatever vehicle my brain comes up with and suddenly decides to model. Currently, it has these vehicles:</span></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;text-decoration:underline\">Grumman F-14 Tomcat</span></span></strong></span></h1>\n  <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"386\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gjyequo.png\" width=\"687\"/></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Sukhoi Su-57 'Felon'</span></span></strong></span></h1>\n  <p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://imgur.com/gallery/La1M2fT\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://imgur.com/gallery/La1M2fT\"/><img alt=\"\" height=\"384\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/06X9FfT.png\" width=\"683\"/></strong></span></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Lockheed F-104 Starfighter</span></span></strong></span></p>\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ciZSayY.png\" width=\"681\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Loc</span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">kheed Martin F-35 Lightning C</span></span></strong></span></h1>\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"385\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4mQ5wsa.png\" width=\"685\"/></span></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">McDonnell Douglas AV-8B Harrier II</span></strong></span><img alt=\"\" height=\"386\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6C9RFrD.png\" width=\"686\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</h1>\n  <p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong>Благодарности Blazewolf1122, Franz и NaxGeneral за помощь в сборке.<br>И Connie, Cactus, Mic и Fsend за их потрясающие схемы!<br></strong></span></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#f00\">Этот модуль</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#f00\"> req</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#f00\">uires:</span></strong></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#f00\">immersive vehicles ( <span style=\"color:#000080\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator</a></span> )</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#036\">&nbsp;для работы.</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#f00\">Другие пакеты, которые вам могут понравиться!<br></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000080\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-generals-general-vehicles-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-generals-general-vehicles-pack</a></span></strong></span></p>\n  <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-airport-pack-immersive-vehicles-content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-airport-pack-immersive-vehicles-content</a></span></strong></span></p>\n  <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-iv-cactuss-decor-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-iv-cactuss-decor-pack</a></span></strong></span></p>\n  <p><span style=\"color:#000080\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vashkmat-immersive-vehicles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vashkmat-immersive-vehicles</a></span></strong></span></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><strong style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Все багаги и ошибки пишите в дискорд ( <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8yRkKTRZkf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/8yRkKTRZkf</a> ), Ping&nbsp;HashimIsaPotato#2879</span></strong></p>\n  <p><strong style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Добавляйте этот мод в свой модпак, обязательно ссылайтесь на него!</span></strong></p>\n  <p><strong style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><br></span></strong><strong style=\"color:#f9c;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Наслаждайтесь полётами и стратегическими бомбёжками.</strong><strong style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><br></span></strong></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><strong style=\"color:#f9c;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">С любовью и болью, множеством боли.</strong></p>\n  <p><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">-Potat boi</strong></span></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n </body>\n</html>",
